["selfPoint"] = "CENTER",
["cooldown"] = false,
["useAdjustededMin"] = false,
["regionType"] = "icon",
["displayIcon"] = "132792",
["desc"] = "This WeakAura enhances the LFG application viewer by showing raid progression or a \"NEW\" label next to each applicant’s name.\n\nIt uses Raider.IO data to determine the highest difficulty and boss kill count the player has completed for the current raid tier, displaying this as a colored [X/8N||H||M] tag.\n\nIf the player has no progression data or is an alt with no main linked, it marks them as NEW in green. \n\nTo improve visual clarity, names are truncated to 10 characters if a progression tag is displayed, avoiding overlap with role icons.\n\nIdeal for raid leaders organizing Learner Runs or vetting applicants at a glance.",
